{"route":"/news-highlights/1392-registration-open-for-the-two-day-workshop-on-enhancing-pharmacopoeial-standards-and-safety-reliance-through-scientific-publications-28–29-august-2025","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on \"Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |"}],"updated":"2025-08-25","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1392-registration-open-for-the-two-day-workshop-on-enhancing-pharmacopoeial-standards-and-safety-reliance-through-scientific-publications-28%E2%80%9329-august-2025.html","title":"Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on \"Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |","bodyHtml":"<div>\n<div><strong>Two-Day Workshop on \"Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications\"</strong></div>\n</div> 28–<span>29 August 2025 | 9:30 AM onwards</span>\n<div><strong>IPC Headquarters, Ghaziabad</strong></div>\n\n\n<div><strong><span>Mode:</span></strong><span> Physical</span></div>\n<div><strong><span>Registration Fee: </span></strong><span> ₹ 2950/- (including 18% GST)</span></div>\n<div><span><span><strong>Register Here: </strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScnnPtWZ6kFx_zzvE_zveXFxpmvTOq1rlu8aG8XUabjiByAjQ/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScnnPtWZ6kFx_zzvE_zveXFxpmvTOq1rlu8aG8XUabjiByAjQ/viewform<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></span></span></div>\n<div><span><strong>Last Date of Registration:</strong> 27th August<span> 2025</span></span> </div>\n<div><span><br></span>\n<div><span></span></div>\n<div><strong>Why Attend?</strong></div>\n<div> Build scientific writing &amp; publication skills</div>\n<div> Enhance visibility and quality of research outputs</div>\n<div> Learn evolving editorial standards and ethical practices</div>\n<div> Understand pharmacopoeial and regulatory implications</div>\n\n<div><span></span></div>\n<div><strong>Interact with Experts from AIIMS, PGIMER, NIPER &amp; NITI Aayog</strong></div>\n<div><span></span></div>\n\n<div><strong>Topics to be covered:</strong></div>\n<div> • Advanced analytical techniques in pharmacopoeia</div>\n<div> • Impurity documentation and drug safety</div>\n<div> • Editor’s insights on review, revision &amp; rejection</div>\n<div> • Avoiding predatory journals</div>\n<div> • Legal and ethical concerns in scientific writing</div>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Publication_Workshop_Brochure_V_page-0001.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on &quot;Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Publication_Workshop_Brochure_V_page-0002.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on &quot;Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Publication_Workshop_Brochure_V_page-0003.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on &quot;Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Publication_Workshop_Brochure_V_page-0004.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on &quot;Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Publication_Workshop_Brochure_V_page-00051.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Registration Open for the Two-Day Workshop on &quot;Enhancing Pharmacopoeial Standards and Safety Reliance through Scientific Publications| 28–29 August 2025 |\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></div>\n\n</div>","date":"2025-08-06","category":"Training & Internships"}